{"id":"twitter:1688580616101433345","tweet_id":"1688580616101433345","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1688580616101433345","title":"@Bunnygotbad @BonkingtonJones @X @Support Maybe Paul does not understand the real life consequences of calling people child molesters when they work i","summary":"@Bunnygotbad @BonkingtonJones @X @Support Maybe Paul does not understand the real life consequences of calling people child molesters when they work in mandatory reporting fields like teaching. Cant block his accounts. Paul makes new ones. Posts my photo and defames me over and over from multiple accounts https://t.co/0tCuetJKiD","date":"2023-08-07","published":"2023-08-07T15:59:25+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/Buggedbunnny/status/1688579137479331840","reply_tweet_id":"1688579137479331840","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Bunnygotbad @BonkingtonJones @X @Support Maybe Paul  does not understand the real life consequences of calling people child molesters when they work in mandatory reporting fields like teaching.<br><br>Cant block his accounts. Paul makes new ones.<br><br>Posts my photo and defames me over and over from multiple accounts <a href=\"https://t.co/0tCuetJKiD\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/0tCuetJKiD</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/a9f9ec8b1a1dd9d490d098fa8bd26712.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/5748c9acdfe14dddd51edc75e395e013.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1688580616101433345","display_date":"August 07, 2023 · 15:59 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/a9f9ec8b1a1dd9d490d098fa8bd26712.jpg","/archive/twitter/media/5748c9acdfe14dddd51edc75e395e013.jpg"]}
