{"id":"twitter:1688560108547317760","tweet_id":"1688560108547317760","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1688560108547317760","title":"@exileoftza I love our model of federated parades. We haven't held a military parade since 1991 (when they showed off the Patriot Missile System) Inst","summary":"@exileoftza I love our model of federated parades. We haven't held a military parade since 1991 (when they showed off the Patriot Missile System) Instead every town and city in America does their own, usually organized by a charity or veterans group We also blow up a lot of stuff. https://t.co/W398oGkEbp","date":"2023-08-07","published":"2023-08-07T14:37:56+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/exileoftza/status/1688513987137183744","reply_tweet_id":"1688513987137183744","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@exileoftza I love our model of federated parades. We haven&#x27;t held a military parade since 1991 (when they showed off the Patriot Missile System)<br><br>Instead every town and city in America does their own, usually organized by a charity or veterans group<br><br>We also blow up a lot of stuff. <a href=\"https://t.co/W398oGkEbp\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/W398oGkEbp</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/b7d5658847cb3c059e0f72bc968e07c2.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/d4d68342954d5266b110e7c8ead746c2.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/d2b2ca365cd6ddd738f42548b17b3edc.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1688560108547317760","display_date":"August 07, 2023 · 14:37 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/b7d5658847cb3c059e0f72bc968e07c2.jpg","/archive/twitter/media/d4d68342954d5266b110e7c8ead746c2.