{"id":"twitter:1688498792364961793","tweet_id":"1688498792364961793","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1688498792364961793","title":"@AngryOniOn7 @NTP2505LF @bucktron2021 @BanderaFella @BonkingtonJones @TickedOffTurnip @StinkyAsparagus @tuckfrump43ver @ShortingRound @DD_Geopolitic @","summary":"@AngryOniOn7 @NTP2505LF @bucktron2021 @BanderaFella @BonkingtonJones @TickedOffTurnip @StinkyAsparagus @tuckfrump43ver @ShortingRound @DD_Geopolitic @PaulDBedson @Paul_Bedson @Reportinat0r @Bellingdawg @HidolfAdlerNAFO @PeImenPusha @PelmenPusha @AnikaBedson @ChadDBedson @X Nobody does this Paul. I have had one account for 14 years that's it. You are probably","date":"2023-08-07","published":"2023-08-07T10:34:17+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/ArchaeologyX/status/1688492111644024832","reply_tweet_id":"1688492111644024832","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@AngryOniOn7 @NTP2505LF @bucktron2021 @BanderaFella @BonkingtonJones @TickedOffTurnip @StinkyAsparagus @tuckfrump43ver @ShortingRound @DD_Geopolitic @PaulDBedson @Paul_Bedson @Reportinat0r @Bellingdawg @HidolfAdlerNAFO @PeImenPusha @PelmenPusha @AnikaBedson @ChadDBedson @X Nobody does this Paul.<br><br>I have had one account for 14 years that&#x27;s it. <br><br>You are probably the only person in the world with four Twitter accounts to stalk and harras people online.<br><br>It is way more than four  accounts too Paul.  You go through dozens.<br><br>Not sure why @X allows it <a href=\"https://t.co/PUFZNSFNj5\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/PUFZNSFNj5</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/a212fbc39974834e3e4cec3a5ee77947.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/2161e67056831a74f3a364bf90ed47ab.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1688498792364961793","display_date":"August 07, 2023 · 10:34 UTC","acces