{"id":"twitter:1688355269791694848","tweet_id":"1688355269791694848","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1688355269791694848","title":"@skykiss22 @ford_nik @Sadike25 We were creating OER network, art+feminism @Wikipedia edits, and capturing Indigenous language and folk on @Wikidata Ch","summary":"@skykiss22 @ford_nik @Sadike25 We were creating OER network, art+feminism @Wikipedia edits, and capturing Indigenous language and folk on @Wikidata Check out @dagbaniwiki trying to train cohort of leaders when Covid hit. Went remote. Then cost of data skyrocketed. Had to fundraise to keep people online","date":"2023-08-07","published":"2023-08-07T01:03:59+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/skykiss22/status/1688350472397287424","reply_tweet_id":"1688350472397287424","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@skykiss22 @ford_nik @Sadike25 We were creating  OER network, art+feminism @Wikipedia edits, and capturing Indigenous language and folk on @Wikidata<br><br>Check out @dagbaniwiki<br><br>trying to train cohort of leaders when Covid hit.  Went remote.<br><br>Then cost of data skyrocketed. Had to fundraise to keep people online</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1688355269791694848","display_date":"August 07, 2023 · 01:03 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1688348017827446785","tweet_id":"1688348017827446785","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1688348017827446785","title":"@Orthodoxru78 @DietHeartNews @vicktop55 That is a protest. There was no coup. Yanukovych fled. The Rada voted 328-0 to oust him. How can there be a Mc","summary":"@Orthodoxru78 @DietHeartNews @vicktop55 That is a protest. There was no coup. Yanukovych fled. The Rada voted 328-0 to oust him. How can there be a McCain/Nuland coup if no Ukrainian illegally seized power? https://t.co/0JDaE6Ddye","date":"2023-08-07","published":"2023-08-07T00:35:10+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/Orthodoxru78/status/1688346829929242624","reply_tweet_id":"1688346829929242624","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Orthodoxru78 @DietHeartNews @vicktop55 That is a protest.<br><br>There was no coup.<br><br>Yanukovych fled.<br><br>The Rada voted 328-0 to oust him.<br><br>How can there be a McCain/Nuland coup if no Ukrainian illegally seized power? <a href=\"https://t.co/0JDaE6Ddye\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/0JDaE6Ddye</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/80e8d7222934daab8d1faec77c188161.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1688348017827446785","display_date":"August 07, 2023 · 00:35 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/80e8d7222934daab8d1faec77c188161.jpg"]}
