{"id":"twitter:1687928727009665024","tweet_id":"1687928727009665024","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1687928727009665024","title":"@DD_Geopolitic @StinkyAsparagus @ne_vluchiv @FrankTrent28 @ChadDBedson It is my actual picture. He just spams it 30-40 times a day. It is is the wallp","summary":"@DD_Geopolitic @StinkyAsparagus @ne_vluchiv @FrankTrent28 @ChadDBedson It is my actual picture. He just spams it 30-40 times a day. It is is the wallpaper on his laptop, and he has a few printed pics all stuck together next to his special sock. It is an attempt at nihilistic rage bait mixed with a weird crush on me. Has to do with guilt I think.","date":"2023-08-05","published":"2023-08-05T20:49:03+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/NoNazisInRussia/status/1687926155314102272","reply_tweet_id":"1687926155314102272","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@DD_Geopolitic @StinkyAsparagus @ne_vluchiv @FrankTrent28 @ChadDBedson It is my actual picture.<br><br>He just spams it 30-40 times a day. It is is the wallpaper on his laptop, and he has a few printed pics all stuck together next to his special sock.<br><br>It is an attempt at nihilistic rage bait mixed with a weird crush on me.<br><br>Has to do with guilt I think.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1687928727009665024","display_date":"August 05, 2023 · 20:49 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
