{"id":"twitter:1686686458088767488","tweet_id":"1686686458088767488","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1686686458088767488","title":"@LitaGillies @BzhNafoFella @srpska007 @Peatoncito Why are you repeating Russian lies? The LPR and DPR were always Russia. The artillery was used as Ov","summary":"@LitaGillies @BzhNafoFella @srpska007 @Peatoncito Why are you repeating Russian lies? The LPR and DPR were always Russia. The artillery was used as Overwatch for mechanized infantry about 5-8 km behind front lines. You can map the use of artillery and see a skirmish line. https://t.co/P8nFB5MVA5","date":"2023-08-02","published":"2023-08-02T10:32:43+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/LitaGillies/status/1686671330450776064","reply_tweet_id":"1686671330450776064","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@LitaGillies @BzhNafoFella @srpska007 @Peatoncito Why are you repeating Russian lies?<br><br>The LPR and DPR were always Russia.<br><br>The artillery was used as Overwatch for mechanized infantry about 5-8 km behind front lines.<br><br>You can map the use of artillery and see a skirmish line. <a href=\"https://t.co/P8nFB5MVA5\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/P8nFB5MVA5</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/9fe6a028019e709ea308ee5a0ac897af.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1686686458088767488","display_date":"August 02, 2023 · 10:32 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/9fe6a028019e709ea308ee5a0ac897af.jpg"]}
