{"id":"twitter:1686427060909068304","tweet_id":"1686427060909068304","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1686427060909068304","title":"@KvotheTheArcane @CantankerousH Harvesting would have been a better word than \"donor\" or course it is an OG anti-semitic trope https://www.wired.com/s","summary":"@KvotheTheArcane @CantankerousH Harvesting would have been a better word than \"donor\" or course it is an OG anti-semitic trope https://www.wired.com/story/opinion-the-dark-virality-of-a-hollywood-blood-harvesting-conspiracy/ but it's hard to know if Russia invents the antisemitism, uses it, or if Russia and antisemtisim live in a symboitic relationship as a ","date":"2023-08-01","published":"2023-08-01T17:21:58+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1686426478118850560","reply_tweet_id":"1686426478118850560","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@KvotheTheArcane @CantankerousH Harvesting would have been a better word than &quot;donor&quot; or course it is an OG anti-semitic trope<br><br><a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/opinion-the-dark-virality-of-a-hollywood-blood-harvesting-conspiracy/\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://www.wired.com/story/opinion-the-dark-virality-of-a-hollywood-blood-harvesting-conspiracy/</a><br><br>but it&#x27;s hard to know if Russia invents the antisemitism, uses it, or if Russia and antisemtisim live in a symboitic relationship as a parasite on world</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1686427060909068304","display_date":"August 01, 2023 · 17:21 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
