{"id":"twitter:1686407219670110208","tweet_id":"1686407219670110208","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1686407219670110208","title":"@KvotheTheArcane @CantankerousH never doubt American entrepreneurialism ability at appropriation Even if wild stereotype if Black Women in New York wa","summary":"@KvotheTheArcane @CantankerousH never doubt American entrepreneurialism ability at appropriation Even if wild stereotype if Black Women in New York want to look more Ukrainian that's cool. Anything cool in America starts off Black, Brown, and/or gay first. (or folks could just walk to East Village to learn)","date":"2023-08-01","published":"2023-08-01T16:03:07+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/KvotheTheArcane/status/1686403819024855040","reply_tweet_id":"1686403819024855040","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@KvotheTheArcane @CantankerousH never doubt American entrepreneurialism ability at appropriation<br><br>Even if wild stereotype if Black Women in New York want to look more Ukrainian that&#x27;s cool.<br><br>Anything cool in America starts off Black, Brown, and/or gay first. <br><br>(or folks could just walk to East Village to learn)</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1686407219670110208","display_date":"August 01, 2023 · 16:03 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
