{"id":"twitter:1686381968047628289","tweet_id":"1686381968047628289","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1686381968047628289","title":"@zhurov101 @KrakowDragon1 @DzonBedson @NAFOfellaLotte @PeteeM3 @AngrierPotato2 @AngryOniOn7 @russophobic_p @Alephi_01 @SLAV_Tchazzar @RodgerNorman4 @F","summary":"@zhurov101 @KrakowDragon1 @DzonBedson @NAFOfellaLotte @PeteeM3 @AngrierPotato2 @AngryOniOn7 @russophobic_p @Alephi_01 @SLAV_Tchazzar @RodgerNorman4 @FrankTrenton1 @AngriestTomato @TheReportinator @ChadDBedson @PaulDBedson @Bellingdawg @Bellingdog2 @ReportinatorClb @Reportinat0r @georgegalloway @MoatsTV @RabbiUkraine You dumb assess realize it is Warsaw Upris","date":"2023-08-01","published":"2023-08-01T14:22:47+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1686380773178511367","reply_tweet_id":"1686380773178511367","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@zhurov101 @KrakowDragon1 @DzonBedson @NAFOfellaLotte @PeteeM3 @AngrierPotato2 @AngryOniOn7 @russophobic_p @Alephi_01 @SLAV_Tchazzar @RodgerNorman4 @FrankTrenton1 @AngriestTomato @TheReportinator @ChadDBedson @PaulDBedson @Bellingdawg @Bellingdog2 @ReportinatorClb @Reportinat0r @georgegalloway @MoatsTV @RabbiUkraine You dumb assess realize it is Warsaw Uprising Memorial Day<br><br>Warsaw Uprising was a major operation  of the Polish resistance Home Army during World War II. <br><br>Began on  August 1, 1944 and lasted for 2 months and 1 day. <br><br>So yeah...not best day to tell Poles they should be grateful <a href=\"https://t.co/F9Cmbi8Vij\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/F9Cmbi8Vij</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/afae4b5e299a1e2c46ce29b4d804c264.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1686381968047628289","display_date":"August 01, 2023 · 14:22 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/afae4b5e299a1e2c46ce29