{"id":"twitter:1686380434287099904","tweet_id":"1686380434287099904","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1686380434287099904","title":"@exileoftza The other issue @exileoftza is this Had zero problems on Twitter before Elon. Now find that anytime I push back on the Russian Narrative o","summary":"@exileoftza The other issue @exileoftza is this Had zero problems on Twitter before Elon. Now find that anytime I push back on the Russian Narrative or criticize Twitter I am immediately throttled Many NAFO have had permanent search ban for months We put a lot of works in to be erased https://t.co/kGjnVAaXD2","date":"2023-08-01","published":"2023-08-01T14:16:41+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1686347128430338048","reply_tweet_id":"1686347128430338048","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@exileoftza The other issue @exileoftza is this<br><br>Had zero problems on Twitter before Elon.<br><br>Now find that anytime I push back on the Russian Narrative  or criticize Twitter I am immediately throttled<br><br>Many NAFO have had permanent search ban for months<br><br>We put a lot of works in to be erased <a href=\"https://t.co/kGjnVAaXD2\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/kGjnVAaXD2</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/7e0e616531fe6ec46d3577c8ac269657.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1686380434287099904","display_date":"August 01, 2023 · 14:16 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/7e0e616531fe6ec46d3577c8ac269657.jpg"]}
