{"id":"twitter:1686371120411258880","tweet_id":"1686371120411258880","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1686371120411258880","title":"Hey NAFO a lot of my friends hit with sim-swap attacks on Twitter Even with an auth app or yubikey, if your account still has SMS 2FA enabled a sim sw","summary":"Hey NAFO a lot of my friends hit with sim-swap attacks on Twitter Even with an auth app or yubikey, if your account still has SMS 2FA enabled a sim swapper can change your password, email, and authentication preferences. Twitter is swamped right now with trouble tickets","date":"2023-08-01","published":"2023-08-01T13:39:41+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Hey NAFO a lot of my friends hit with  sim-swap attacks on Twitter<br><br>Even with an auth app or yubikey, if your account still has SMS 2FA enabled a sim swapper can change your password, email, and authentication preferences.<br><br>Twitter is swamped right now with trouble tickets</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1686371120411258880","display_date":"August 01, 2023 · 13:39 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
