{"id":"twitter:1686048649858392064","tweet_id":"1686048649858392064","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1686048649858392064","title":"@ThomasGunnFL @JuneHog @jjfThompson keep going amendment #10 Tenth Amendment basically says Federal Government only has those powers delegated in the ","summary":"@ThomasGunnFL @JuneHog @jjfThompson keep going amendment #10 Tenth Amendment basically says Federal Government only has those powers delegated in the Constitution thus the Tenth Amendment does not override any article delegating powers to the Federal Government like there might be case law and precedent...","date":"2023-07-31","published":"2023-07-31T16:18:18+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/ThomasGunnFL/status/1686047630273527809","reply_tweet_id":"1686047630273527809","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@ThomasGunnFL @JuneHog @jjfThompson keep going<br><br>amendment #10<br><br>Tenth Amendment basically says  Federal Government only has those powers delegated in the Constitution thus the Tenth Amendment does not override any article delegating powers to the Federal Government<br><br>like there might be case law and precedent...</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1686048649858392064","display_date":"July 31, 2023 · 16:18 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
