{"id":"twitter:1685378149696094208","tweet_id":"1685378149696094208","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1685378149696094208","title":"@Agent_Dreamer @smackm8 @timbo1092 @LilaNatalijka @NafoBrotherD @Official_NAFO There are awesome programs here Stateside and also other companies work","summary":"@Agent_Dreamer @smackm8 @timbo1092 @LilaNatalijka @NafoBrotherD @Official_NAFO There are awesome programs here Stateside and also other companies working on network solutions. Companies in NATO nations can often sub on a variety of DoD and SBIR awards depending on US export controls. Have an idea.. Run with it.","date":"2023-07-29","published":"2023-07-29T19:53:58+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1685377530415751168","reply_tweet_id":"1685377530415751168","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Agent_Dreamer @smackm8 @timbo1092 @LilaNatalijka @NafoBrotherD @Official_NAFO There are awesome programs here Stateside and also other companies working on network solutions.<br><br>Companies in NATO nations can often sub on a variety of DoD and SBIR awards depending on US export controls.<br><br>Have an idea.. Run with it.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1685378149696094208","display_date":"July 29, 2023 · 19:53 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
