{"id":"twitter:1685354593813741568","tweet_id":"1685354593813741568","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1685354593813741568","title":"@official_ninr @antinafo3 Why do you take issue with a group of volunteer fundraisers who raise money for volunteer units by having volunteer artists ","summary":"@official_ninr @antinafo3 Why do you take issue with a group of volunteer fundraisers who raise money for volunteer units by having volunteer artists draw you a PFP in the Public Domain? raised over 10 million dollars, shipped over 200 vehicles to Ukraine. What's your beef? Sounds like nothing burger https://t.co/8waWni77OW","date":"2023-07-29","published":"2023-07-29T18:20:22+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/official_ninr/status/1685168421829505024","reply_tweet_id":"1685168421829505024","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@official_ninr @antinafo3 Why do you take issue with a group of volunteer fundraisers who raise money for volunteer units by having volunteer artists draw you a PFP in the Public Domain?<br><br>raised over 10 million dollars, shipped over 200 vehicles to Ukraine.<br><br>What&#x27;s your beef? Sounds like nothing burger <a href=\"https://t.co/8waWni77OW\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/8waWni77OW</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/7fed5ccb02486ed401eb2c1036b79780.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1685354593813741568","display_date":"July 29, 2023 · 18:20 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/7fed5ccb02486ed401eb2c1036b79780.jpg"]}
