{"id":"twitter:1685350270459416576","tweet_id":"1685350270459416576","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1685350270459416576","title":"@_Classical_Lib_ @francescrogo @charmantwieBrot @squatsons I too would be interested in anyone writing about Russia planning a feint to capture Ukrain","summary":"@_Classical_Lib_ @francescrogo @charmantwieBrot @squatsons I too would be interested in anyone writing about Russia planning a feint to capture Ukraine in a cauldron? Where? Russia keeps putting, and losing, their best around Svatove-Kreminna. But everything shipped to the Central Military District strips reserves from the CAAs of SMD","date":"2023-07-29","published":"2023-07-29T18:03:11+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1685349467669598208","reply_tweet_id":"1685349467669598208","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@_Classical_Lib_ @francescrogo @charmantwieBrot @squatsons I too would be interested in anyone writing about Russia planning a feint to capture Ukraine in a cauldron?<br><br>Where?<br><br>Russia keeps putting, and losing, their best around Svatove-Kreminna.<br><br>But everything shipped to the Central Military District strips reserves from the CAAs of SMD</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1685350270459416576","display_date":"July 29, 2023 · 18:03 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1685349467669598208","tweet_id":"1685349467669598208","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1685349467669598208","title":"@_Classical_Lib_ @francescrogo @charmantwieBrot @squatsons My guess your opinion is off Look at Russian dispositions along each axis. Fighting has bee","summary":"@_Classical_Lib_ @francescrogo @charmantwieBrot @squatsons My guess your opinion is off Look at Russian dispositions along each axis. Fighting has been fierce but Russia is running out of reserve forces. In Southern MOD is down to just the 29th CAA. What we really see are a ton of GLOC going kabloowie behind the line https://t.co/e686b8KnG6","date":"2023-07-29","published":"2023-07-29T18:00:00+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/_Classical_Lib_/status/1685348098975928320","reply_tweet_id":"1685348098975928320","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@_Classical_Lib_ @francescrogo @charmantwieBrot @squatsons My guess your opinion is off<br><br>Look at Russian dispositions along each axis. Fighting has been fierce but Russia is running out of reserve forces.<br><br>In  Southern MOD is down to just the 29th CAA.<br><br>What we really see are a ton of GLOC going kabloowie behind the line <a href=\"https://t.co/e686b8KnG6\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/e686b8KnG6</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/e7c416299c06f66798b0192f4ae914e1.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1685349467669598208","display_date":"July 29, 2023 · 18:00 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/e7c416299c06f66798b0192f4ae914e1.jpg"]}
