{"id":"twitter:1685318009320026112","tweet_id":"1685318009320026112","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1685318009320026112","title":"@Veronichkapinke @lyssafella No I am saying @lyssafella was not wrong and Poland and Germany really got WW2 going together. You countered with \"But Ge","summary":"@Veronichkapinke @lyssafella No I am saying @lyssafella was not wrong and Poland and Germany really got WW2 going together. You countered with \"But Germany had Concentration Camps\" I then explained Russia kept the Concentration Camps open. It just happened to be the one where Bandera spent the war.","date":"2023-07-29","published":"2023-07-29T15:54:59+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/Veronichkapinke/status/1685316751590924288","reply_tweet_id":"1685316751590924288","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Veronichkapinke @lyssafella No I am saying @lyssafella was not wrong and Poland and Germany really got WW2 going together.<br><br>You countered with &quot;But Germany had Concentration Camps&quot;<br><br>I then explained Russia kept the Concentration Camps open.<br><br>It just happened to be the one where Bandera spent the war.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1685318009320026112","display_date":"July 29, 2023 · 15:54 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
