{"id":"twitter:1685007974744440833","tweet_id":"1685007974744440833","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1685007974744440833","title":"@_c_a_l_i_n_ @ProfessorP5 @JL3811X It's different for us in USA, or at least where I live, and with my peer groups can honestly say I have never met a","summary":"@_c_a_l_i_n_ @ProfessorP5 @JL3811X It's different for us in USA, or at least where I live, and with my peer groups can honestly say I have never met a Russian who didn't want to see Russia burn Only Ukrainians want to see Russia burn more than Russians I know (can't say on Twitter what Polish friends would do)","date":"2023-07-28","published":"2023-07-28T19:23:01+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/_c_a_l_i_n_/status/1685007014064275456","reply_tweet_id":"1685007014064275456","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@_c_a_l_i_n_ @ProfessorP5 @JL3811X It&#x27;s different for us in  USA, or at least where I live, and with my peer groups<br><br>can honestly say I have never met a Russian who didn&#x27;t want to see Russia burn<br><br>Only Ukrainians want to see Russia burn more than Russians I know (can&#x27;t say on Twitter what Polish friends would do)</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1685007974744440833","display_date":"July 28, 2023 · 19:23 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1685007154615296000","tweet_id":"1685007154615296000","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1685007154615296000","title":"what does it mean to meme meaning of utterances in a sputtering of nonludic discourses dancing in abhorrent metaphors of mixed meaning seeing concrete","summary":"what does it mean to meme meaning of utterances in a sputtering of nonludic discourses dancing in abhorrent metaphors of mixed meaning seeing concrete, pragmatic effects of taking a brick to the dome? #smallpoems #nafo https://t.co/lXpHJE4Bl7","date":"2023-07-28","published":"2023-07-28T19:19:46+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":["smallpoems","nafo"],"body_html":"<p>what does it <br> mean to meme<br> meaning of <br>utterances in a<br> sputtering of<br>nonludic <br>discourses dancing<br>in<br>abhorrent metaphors<br> of mixed meaning<br>seeing concrete, pragmatic<br>effects of<br>taking a brick to the <br>dome?<br>#smallpoems<br>#nafo <a href=\"https://t.co/lXpHJE4Bl7\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/lXpHJE4Bl7</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/935ebb050c824a65582db7bf49bc5b21.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1685007154615296000","display_date":"July 28, 2023 · 19:19 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/935ebb050c824a65582db7bf49bc5b21.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:1685003409923952640","tweet_id":"1685003409923952640","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1685003409923952640","title":"@ProfessorP5 @JL3811X @_c_a_l_i_n_ I am way more Deleuze and Guattari rather than Dawkinsian memetics ,but still your thesis is stretch for any logic ","summary":"@ProfessorP5 @JL3811X @_c_a_l_i_n_ I am way more Deleuze and Guattari rather than Dawkinsian memetics ,but still your thesis is stretch for any logic tree we can see lines of flights when poking fun at genocidal invaders NAFO can be torn, reversed, adapted to any kind of mounting. NAFO will mount any meaning https://t.co/aml3TqFZ4c","date":"2023-07-28","published":"2023-07-28T19:04:53+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/ProfessorP5/status/1685001802121379840","reply_tweet_id":"1685001802121379840","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@ProfessorP5 @JL3811X @_c_a_l_i_n_ I am way more Deleuze and Guattari rather than Dawkinsian memetics ,but still your thesis is stretch for any logic tree<br><br>we can see lines of flights when poking fun at genocidal invaders<br><br>NAFO can be torn, reversed, adapted to any kind of mounting.<br><br>NAFO will mount any meaning <a href=\"https://t.co/aml3TqFZ4c\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/aml3TqFZ4c</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/b6106a3a58e0ae1fcc0b6dda771fb604.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1685003409923952640","display_date":"July 28, 2023 · 19:04 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/b6106a3a58e0ae1fcc0b6dda771fb604.jpg"]}
