{"id":"twitter:1684996620889243648","tweet_id":"1684996620889243648","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1684996620889243648","title":"We dance in steps more than signifier and sign. Fires and sickles in bifurcated illustrations by forsaken exploration of tattered brushes, bristles cr","summary":"We dance in steps more than signifier and sign. Fires and sickles in bifurcated illustrations by forsaken exploration of tattered brushes, bristles cracked and hardened more scores of scars on canvas fanning splashes of dry reality #smallpoems","date":"2023-07-28","published":"2023-07-28T18:37:54+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":["smallpoems"],"body_html":"<p>We dance<br>in steps more<br>than signifier and<br>sign.<br><br> Fires and sickles<br>in bifurcated<br>illustrations<br>by forsaken <br>exploration of<br>tattered <br>brushes, bristles<br>cracked and<br> hardened<br><br>more scores of<br>scars on canvas<br> fanning splashes<br>of dry reality<br><br>#smallpoems</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1684996620889243648","display_date":"July 28, 2023 · 18:37 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
