{"id":"twitter:1683272985103220736","tweet_id":"1683272985103220736","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1683272985103220736","title":"@HPM1984Concord @hodie_heathen @Epifrenetics My throttle issues started for the first time in 14 years as soon as Elon took over 1st degree signals, w","summary":"@HPM1984Concord @hodie_heathen @Epifrenetics My throttle issues started for the first time in 14 years as soon as Elon took over 1st degree signals, were the best remedy, meaning chats within followers and following I think rate limits probably pollute these tools and API limits shoulda broke most of these tools. https://t.co/REBC75GEvL","date":"2023-07-24","published":"2023-07-24T00:28:48+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/HPM1984Concord/status/1683268878657368066","reply_tweet_id":"1683268878657368066","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@HPM1984Concord @hodie_heathen @Epifrenetics My throttle issues started for the first time in 14 years as soon as Elon took over<br><br>1st degree signals, were the best remedy, meaning chats within followers and following<br><br>I think rate limits probably pollute these tools and API limits shoulda broke most of these tools. <a href=\"https://t.co/REBC75GEvL\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/REBC75GEvL</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/11b99aa27997f2a1bff3c6af59ca6d10.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1683272985103220736","display_date":"July 24, 2023 · 00:28 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/11b99aa27997f2a1bff3c6af59ca6d10.jpg"]}
