{"id":"twitter:1682543025795346435","tweet_id":"1682543025795346435","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1682543025795346435","title":"@SophiePerrin18 @randymot4 @MattPPea Don't count Washington in foreign diplomacy because we were in no way ready as a young nation. He had IRS agents ","summary":"@SophiePerrin18 @randymot4 @MattPPea Don't count Washington in foreign diplomacy because we were in no way ready as a young nation. He had IRS agents to arm first. Adams passed Alien and Sedition Acts, Created Navy and Marines, but was dealing with France and was less interventiony (unless I am mixing up Prez) 1/2","date":"2023-07-22","published":"2023-07-22T00:08:12+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/SophiePerrin18/status/1682541138719170566","reply_tweet_id":"1682541138719170566","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@SophiePerrin18 @randymot4 @MattPPea Don&#x27;t count Washington in foreign diplomacy because we were in no way ready as a young nation.<br><br>He had IRS agents to arm first.<br><br>Adams passed Alien and Sedition Acts, Created Navy and Marines, but was dealing with France and was less interventiony (unless I am mixing up Prez) 1/2</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1682543025795346435","display_date":"July 22, 2023 · 00:08 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
