{"id":"twitter:1682394840934522880","tweet_id":"1682394840934522880","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1682394840934522880","title":"@TippersonTrip \"with the Jews Beyond the Pale\" You may not be a Native English speaker but that is called a prepositional phrase with is a preposition","summary":"@TippersonTrip \"with the Jews Beyond the Pale\" You may not be a Native English speaker but that is called a prepositional phrase with is a preposition. It combines with a noun phrase to form a phrase which usually expresses a modification \"As in Stalin is prick with a love for Genocide\"","date":"2023-07-21","published":"2023-07-21T14:19:22+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/TippersonTrip/status/1682393329697439744","reply_tweet_id":"1682393329697439744","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@TippersonTrip &quot;with the Jews Beyond the Pale&quot;<br><br>You may not be a Native English speaker but that is called a prepositional phrase<br><br>with is a preposition. It combines with a noun phrase to form a phrase which usually expresses a modification<br><br>&quot;As in Stalin is prick with a love for Genocide&quot;</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1682394840934522880","display_date":"July 21, 2023 · 14:19 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
