{"id":"twitter:1682038434570072068","tweet_id":"1682038434570072068","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1682038434570072068","title":"@osintjourno @KitKlarenberg @TheGrayzoneNews Yes in the 21st century we call that a \"Doctrine of Terrorism because of Tantrums\" The words are new...bu","summary":"@osintjourno @KitKlarenberg @TheGrayzoneNews Yes in the 21st century we call that a \"Doctrine of Terrorism because of Tantrums\" The words are new...but it's been a pretty Russian way to role for a long time https://t.co/f7o8ha7wE2","date":"2023-07-20","published":"2023-07-20T14:43:08+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/osintjourno/status/1682037404608389129","reply_tweet_id":"1682037404608389129","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@osintjourno @KitKlarenberg @TheGrayzoneNews Yes in the 21st century we call that a &quot;Doctrine of Terrorism because of Tantrums&quot;<br><br>The words are new...but it&#x27;s been a pretty Russian way to role for a long time <a href=\"https://t.co/f7o8ha7wE2\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/f7o8ha7wE2</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/5bdbe1cc00ca713e58471e4016230e94.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1682038434570072068","display_date":"July 20, 2023 · 14:43 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/5bdbe1cc00ca713e58471e4016230e94.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:1682037988241600513","tweet_id":"1682037988241600513","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1682037988241600513","title":"@osintjourno @KitKlarenberg @TheGrayzoneNews You aren't wrong, but you need to consider the goal of the critical infrastructure. It isn't part of a co","summary":"@osintjourno @KitKlarenberg @TheGrayzoneNews You aren't wrong, but you need to consider the goal of the critical infrastructure. It isn't part of a combined arms attack to knock out specific domains It is cultural terrorism to try and destroy a will of an enemy That is the heart of reflexive control' Be a dick https://t.co/ntGIZTVAzb","date":"2023-07-20","published":"2023-07-20T14:41:21+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/osintjourno/status/1682037041587159042","reply_tweet_id":"1682037041587159042","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@osintjourno @KitKlarenberg @TheGrayzoneNews You aren&#x27;t wrong, but you need to consider the goal of the critical infrastructure.<br><br>It isn&#x27;t part of a combined arms attack to knock out specific domains<br><br>It is cultural terrorism to try and destroy a will of an enemy<br><br>That is the heart of reflexive control&#x27;<br><br>Be a dick <a href=\"https://t.co/ntGIZTVAzb\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/ntGIZTVAzb</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/4241fd136fdba8a1ca0efdc39bef42f4.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1682037988241600513","display_date":"July 20, 2023 · 14:41 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/4241fd136fdba8a1ca0efdc39bef42f4.jpg"]}
