{"id":"twitter:1681801268824514567","tweet_id":"1681801268824514567","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1681801268824514567","title":"Here's the list of articles still to finish: https://meta.wikimedia.org/wiki/Ukraine%27s_Cultural_Diplomacy_Month_2023/List A lot of articles want ima","summary":"Here's the list of articles still to finish: https://meta.wikimedia.org/wiki/Ukraine%27s_Cultural_Diplomacy_Month_2023/List A lot of articles want images or translation. For example. I added images of the Madonna of Kyiv. It's a great way to help history not get erased. Feel free to ask for tutorial on getting started https://t.co/eTN8pOBpry","date":"2023-07-19","published":"2023-07-19T23:00:43+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1681800031962030083","reply_tweet_id":"1681800031962030083","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Here&#x27;s the list of articles still to finish: <a href=\"https://meta.wikimedia.org/wiki/Ukraine%27s_Cultural_Diplomacy_Month_2023/List\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://meta.wikimedia.org/wiki/Ukraine%27s_Cultural_Diplomacy_Month_2023/List</a><br><br>A lot of articles want images or translation. For example. I added images of the Madonna of Kyiv.<br><br>It&#x27;s a great way to help history not get erased. Feel free to ask for tutorial on getting started <a href=\"https://t.co/eTN8pOBpry\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/eTN8pOBpry</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/bd1cdd159b7d8dbb7827317a28a40591.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1681801268824514567","display_date":"July 19, 2023 · 23:00 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/bd1cdd159b7d8dbb7827317a28a40591.jpg"]}
