{"id":"twitter:1681746234422312961","tweet_id":"1681746234422312961","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1681746234422312961","title":"@Baccietto @JoohnChoe Otpor! is genesis IMO And I would say the post-modern theorists that influence punk aesthetic and samizdat vibe of NAFO aren't A","summary":"@Baccietto @JoohnChoe Otpor! is genesis IMO And I would say the post-modern theorists that influence punk aesthetic and samizdat vibe of NAFO aren't American either. Sixtiers-Ukrainian Deleuze and Guattari-French Kristeva-Bulgarian Bakhtin-Russian de Saussure-French Foucault-French Soviets Etc","date":"2023-07-19","published":"2023-07-19T19:22:02+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/Baccietto/status/1681738740023144450","reply_tweet_id":"1681738740023144450","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Baccietto @JoohnChoe Otpor! is genesis IMO<br><br>And I would say the post-modern theorists that influence  punk aesthetic and samizdat vibe of NAFO aren&#x27;t American either.<br><br>Sixtiers-Ukrainian <br>Deleuze and Guattari-French<br>Kristeva-Bulgarian<br>Bakhtin-Russian<br> de Saussure-French<br>Foucault-French<br>Soviets<br>Etc</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1681746234422312961","display_date":"July 19, 2023 · 19:22 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
