{"id":"twitter:1681122661542383618","tweet_id":"1681122661542383618","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1681122661542383618","title":"@bucktron2021 @SLAV_Tchazzar @zhurov101 @AngrierPotato2 @Paygan4 @FreeSpeecher123 @FrankTrenton1 @AngriestTomato @TheReportinator @AnikaBedson @ChadDB","summary":"@bucktron2021 @SLAV_Tchazzar @zhurov101 @AngrierPotato2 @Paygan4 @FreeSpeecher123 @FrankTrenton1 @AngriestTomato @TheReportinator @AnikaBedson @ChadDBedson @RodgerNorman4 @PaulDBedson @Bellingdawg @Bellingdog2 @ReportinatorClb @Reportinat0r @TAsparagus85874 @georgegalloway @MoatsTV It isn't hard. You support genocide or you fight it. What is happening in Ukr","date":"2023-07-18","published":"2023-07-18T02:04:10+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/bucktron2021/status/1681117410043269121","reply_tweet_id":"1681117410043269121","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@bucktron2021 @SLAV_Tchazzar @zhurov101 @AngrierPotato2 @Paygan4 @FreeSpeecher123 @FrankTrenton1 @AngriestTomato @TheReportinator @AnikaBedson @ChadDBedson @RodgerNorman4 @PaulDBedson @Bellingdawg @Bellingdog2 @ReportinatorClb @Reportinat0r @TAsparagus85874 @georgegalloway @MoatsTV It isn&#x27;t hard.<br><br>You support genocide or you fight it.<br><br>What is happening in Ukraine is a genocide.<br><br>Why are you finding it to be a difficult moral choice? <a href=\"https://t.co/7sTn2cdHIL\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/7sTn2cdHIL</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/b68840f2eeb40f80b0962e8f3ddee8a8.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1681122661542383618","display_date":"July 18, 2023 · 02:04 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/b68840f2eeb40f80b0962e8f3ddee8a8.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:1681122146976661504","tweet_id":"1681122146976661504","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1681122146976661504","title":"@SLAV_Tchazzar @bucktron2021 @zhurov101 @RodgerNorman4 @AngrierPotato2 @Paygan4 @FreeSpeecher123 @FrankTrenton1 @AngriestTomato @TheReportinator @Anik","summary":"@SLAV_Tchazzar @bucktron2021 @zhurov101 @RodgerNorman4 @AngrierPotato2 @Paygan4 @FreeSpeecher123 @FrankTrenton1 @AngriestTomato @TheReportinator @AnikaBedson @ChadDBedson @PaulDBedson @Bellingdawg @Bellingdog2 @ReportinatorClb @Reportinat0r @TAsparagus85874 @georgegalloway @MoatsTV Does it matter to the dead? Your logic makea no sense. Russia gets to genocid","date":"2023-07-18","published":"2023-07-18T02:02:08+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/SLAV_Tchazzar/status/1681117188927770634","reply_tweet_id":"1681117188927770634","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@SLAV_Tchazzar @bucktron2021 @zhurov101 @RodgerNorman4 @AngrierPotato2 @Paygan4 @FreeSpeecher123 @FrankTrenton1 @AngriestTomato @TheReportinator @AnikaBedson @ChadDBedson @PaulDBedson @Bellingdawg @Bellingdog2 @ReportinatorClb @Reportinat0r @TAsparagus85874 @georgegalloway @MoatsTV Does it matter to the dead?<br><br>Your logic makea no sense.<br><br>Russia gets to genocide Ukraine because Nazis and Russia genocided my family. <a href=\"https://t.co/B5FvKtFu1P\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/B5FvKtFu1P</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/88e3efff1c0c012382c770b03248b619.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1681122146976661504","display_date":"July 18, 2023 · 02:02 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/88e3efff1c0c012382c770b03248b619.jpg"]}
