{"id":"twitter:1681121320573063170","tweet_id":"1681121320573063170","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1681121320573063170","title":"@SLAV_Tchazzar @AngrierPotato2 @Paygan4 @bucktron2021 @FreeSpeecher123 @zhurov101 @FrankTrenton1 @AngriestTomato @TheReportinator @AnikaBedson @ChadDB","summary":"@SLAV_Tchazzar @AngrierPotato2 @Paygan4 @bucktron2021 @FreeSpeecher123 @zhurov101 @FrankTrenton1 @AngriestTomato @TheReportinator @AnikaBedson @ChadDBedson @RodgerNorman4 @PaulDBedson @Bellingdawg @Bellingdog2 @ReportinatorClb @Reportinat0r @TAsparagus85874 @georgegalloway @MoatsTV Saying if you think the Holocaust that killed your family was bad. Then stop ","date":"2023-07-18","published":"2023-07-18T01:58:51+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/SLAV_Tchazzar/status/1681115011698118658","reply_tweet_id":"1681115011698118658","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@SLAV_Tchazzar @AngrierPotato2 @Paygan4 @bucktron2021 @FreeSpeecher123 @zhurov101 @FrankTrenton1 @AngriestTomato @TheReportinator @AnikaBedson @ChadDBedson @RodgerNorman4 @PaulDBedson @Bellingdawg @Bellingdog2 @ReportinatorClb @Reportinat0r @TAsparagus85874 @georgegalloway @MoatsTV Saying if you think the Holocaust that killed your family was bad.<br><br>Then stop the Holocaust that is happening now.<br><br>It is not a hard logical leap.<br><br>Ukraine was killed by Nazis and Russians throughout the war.<br><br>What is wrong with letting them be? <a href=\"https://t.co/q5TXQjOozR\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/q5TXQjOozR</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/a6b227d8f2f57b839d9b86511ac785af.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1681121320573063170","display_date":"July 18, 2023 · 01:58 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/a6b227d8f2f57b839d9b86511ac785af.jpg"]}
