{"id":"twitter:1681095059523919873","tweet_id":"1681095059523919873","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1681095059523919873","title":"@AngrierPotato2 Also a lie Paul. There wasn't a Donbas Civil War. The entire war started in 2014. The Only reason it's just Donetsk and Luhansk is bec","summary":"@AngrierPotato2 Also a lie Paul. There wasn't a Donbas Civil War. The entire war started in 2014. The Only reason it's just Donetsk and Luhansk is because Girkin's neonazi got pinched in Odesa... They tried but they didn't succeed. Same in Karkhiv, but that was juat Nationalist. https://t.co/HTHdqePZRv","date":"2023-07-18","published":"2023-07-18T00:14:30+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/AngrierPotato2/status/1681091881189404672","reply_tweet_id":"1681091881189404672","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@AngrierPotato2 Also a lie Paul.<br><br>There wasn&#x27;t a Donbas Civil War.<br><br>The entire war started in 2014.<br><br>The Only reason it&#x27;s just Donetsk and Luhansk is because Girkin&#x27;s neonazi got pinched in Odesa...<br><br>They tried but they didn&#x27;t succeed. Same in Karkhiv, but that was juat Nationalist. <a href=\"https://t.co/HTHdqePZRv\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/HTHdqePZRv</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/e3c51254eac31130d2bc45c9453bc04d.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1681095059523919873","display_date":"July 18, 2023 · 00:14 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/e3c51254eac31130d2bc45c9453bc04d.jpg"]}
