{"id":"twitter:1681072612405833728","tweet_id":"1681072612405833728","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1681072612405833728","title":"@AngrierPotato2 I never said I reported you once. I said it felt like you were trying to run a campaign from multiple accounts and say mean stuff. Hop","summary":"@AngrierPotato2 I never said I reported you once. I said it felt like you were trying to run a campaign from multiple accounts and say mean stuff. Hoping I'd get mad. That is silly, mister potato head that supports genocide. You should say your sorry and stop doing this. https://t.co/Irix7XtLLF","date":"2023-07-17","published":"2023-07-17T22:45:18+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/AngrierPotato2/status/1681071951438045189","reply_tweet_id":"1681071951438045189","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@AngrierPotato2 I never said I reported you once.<br><br>I said it felt like you were trying to run a campaign from multiple accounts and say mean stuff.<br><br>Hoping I&#x27;d get mad.<br><br>That is silly, mister potato head that supports genocide.<br><br>You should say your sorry and stop doing this. <a href=\"https://t.co/Irix7XtLLF\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/Irix7XtLLF</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/a70d2c38b771531a08df9e3a2a17a612.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1681072612405833728","display_date":"July 17, 2023 · 22:45 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/a70d2c38b771531a08df9e3a2a17a612.jpg"]}
