{"id":"twitter:1681036670739652608","tweet_id":"1681036670739652608","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1681036670739652608","title":"@SLAV_Tchazzar @AngrierPotato2 You could hang out with the Russians of Brighton Beach OMG do they hate Russia more than me I have known so many Russia","summary":"@SLAV_Tchazzar @AngrierPotato2 You could hang out with the Russians of Brighton Beach OMG do they hate Russia more than me I have known so many Russians my whole life. They all hate Russia. It's weird. It's like the opposite of everyone else. https://t.co/VkP2FDNboI","date":"2023-07-17","published":"2023-07-17T20:22:29+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/SLAV_Tchazzar/status/1681034941621051394","reply_tweet_id":"1681034941621051394","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@SLAV_Tchazzar @AngrierPotato2 You could hang out with the Russians of Brighton Beach<br><br>OMG do they hate Russia more than me<br><br>I have known so many Russians my whole life.<br><br>They all hate Russia.<br><br>It&#x27;s weird.<br><br>It&#x27;s like the opposite of everyone else. <a href=\"https://t.co/VkP2FDNboI\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/VkP2FDNboI</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/2de3cd2b6c0b09c0e73771ab538b52f9.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1681036670739652608","display_date":"July 17, 2023 · 20:22 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/2de3cd2b6c0b09c0e73771ab538b52f9.jpg"]}
