{"id":"twitter:1681034691506257921","tweet_id":"1681034691506257921","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1681034691506257921","title":"@SLAV_Tchazzar @AngrierPotato2 It's kinda funny being told how awful I am using my website InterextRevolution A literal remix of a Bulgarian philosoph","summary":"@SLAV_Tchazzar @AngrierPotato2 It's kinda funny being told how awful I am using my website InterextRevolution A literal remix of a Bulgarian philosopher Kristeva, a Russian Literary analysis Bakhtin, and a Russian psychologist Vygotsky. Could be I just think genocide of Ukrainians is wrong. Russia is wrong https://t.co/jUFj8M7WpG","date":"2023-07-17","published":"2023-07-17T20:14:37+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/SLAV_Tchazzar/status/1681033228193243137","reply_tweet_id":"1681033228193243137","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@SLAV_Tchazzar @AngrierPotato2 It&#x27;s kinda funny being told how awful I am using my website InterextRevolution<br><br>A literal remix of a Bulgarian philosopher Kristeva, a Russian Literary analysis Bakhtin, and a Russian psychologist Vygotsky.<br><br>Could be I just think genocide of Ukrainians is wrong.<br><br>Russia is wrong <a href=\"https://t.co/jUFj8M7WpG\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/jUFj8M7WpG</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/89b07ee1e246afd59bf1832262179b5e.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1681034691506257921","display_date":"July 17, 2023 · 20:14 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/89b07ee1e246afd59bf1832262179b5e.jpg"]}
