{"id":"twitter:1681011623648018432","tweet_id":"1681011623648018432","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1681011623648018432","title":"Ivan turns to his third point in thesis: \"also a proxy war between US/NATO and Russia. Ukraine fits definitions of a US client state\" He uses two poin","summary":"Ivan turns to his third point in thesis: \"also a proxy war between US/NATO and Russia. Ukraine fits definitions of a US client state\" He uses two points to prove this: one quote From Secretary Austin and \" NATO provided training\" No editorial board would accept this","date":"2023-07-17","published":"2023-07-17T18:42:57+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1681011404835373056","reply_tweet_id":"1681011404835373056","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Ivan turns to his third point in thesis:  &quot;also a proxy war between  US/NATO and Russia. Ukraine fits definitions of a US client state&quot; <br><br> He uses two points to prove this: <br>one quote From Secretary Austin <br><br>and &quot;<br><br>NATO provided training&quot;  No editorial board would accept this</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1681011623648018432","display_date":"July 17, 2023 · 18:42 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1681011404835373056","tweet_id":"1681011404835373056","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1681011404835373056","title":"In next paragraph Ivan writes: \"analysis of various evidence and the size and deployment of the Russian forces in Ukraine suggest that Russian plans d","summary":"In next paragraph Ivan writes: \"analysis of various evidence and the size and deployment of the Russian forces in Ukraine suggest that Russian plans did not envision the invasion\" but Dr. Ivan includes NO \"analysis of various evidence\" https://t.co/g54CdlWOIi","date":"2023-07-17","published":"2023-07-17T18:42:05+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1681011086697349121","reply_tweet_id":"1681011086697349121","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>In  next paragraph Ivan writes:  &quot;analysis of various evidence and the size and deployment of the Russian forces in Ukraine suggest that Russian plans did not envision the invasion&quot;<br><br> but Dr. Ivan includes NO &quot;analysis of various evidence&quot; <a href=\"https://t.co/g54CdlWOIi\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/g54CdlWOIi</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/315ca645b0014182a920a014b39806f5.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1681011404835373056","display_date":"July 17, 2023 · 18:42 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/315ca645b0014182a920a014b39806f5.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:1681011086697349121","tweet_id":"1681011086697349121","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1681011086697349121","title":"Then Katchanovski cites surveys from KMIS to \"prove\" more people identify as Russian in the East Who does Katchanovski cite? Katchanovski Not survery,","summary":"Then Katchanovski cites surveys from KMIS to \"prove\" more people identify as Russian in the East Who does Katchanovski cite? Katchanovski Not survery, not study, but a self-citation where he mentions a survey. The methodological limitations around KMIS is known","date":"2023-07-17","published":"2023-07-17T18:40:49+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1681010814432559104","reply_tweet_id":"1681010814432559104","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Then Katchanovski cites surveys from KMIS to &quot;prove&quot; more people identify as Russian in the East <br><br> Who does Katchanovski cite?  <br>Katchanovski <br><br> Not survery, not  study, but a self-citation where he mentions a survey.  <br><br>The  methodological limitations around  KMIS  is known</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1681011086697349121","display_date":"July 17, 2023 · 18:40 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
