{"id":"twitter:1681009296862052353","tweet_id":"1681009296862052353","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1681009296862052353","title":"Ivan writes, \"The empirical evidence-based and theory-based academic analysis of the the Russia-Ukraine war and the Maidan transition is needed\" But t","summary":"Ivan writes, \"The empirical evidence-based and theory-based academic analysis of the the Russia-Ukraine war and the Maidan transition is needed\" But the paper has : -No theory section -No Methods section thus it is neither empirical nor theoretical It is nonsense","date":"2023-07-17","published":"2023-07-17T18:33:42+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1681009053399498753","reply_tweet_id":"1681009053399498753","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Ivan writes,   &quot;The empirical evidence-based and theory-based academic analysis of the the Russia-Ukraine war and the Maidan transition is needed&quot;  <br><br>But the paper has :<br>-No theory section <br>-No Methods section<br><br>  thus it is neither empirical nor theoretical  It is nonsense</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1681009296862052353","display_date":"July 17, 2023 · 18:33 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1681009053399498753","tweet_id":"1681009053399498753","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1681009053399498753","title":"Now content analysis of first and accounts or media IS an essential tool of Political Science This isn't that. Ivan Katchanovski gives no more descrip","summary":"Now content analysis of first and accounts or media IS an essential tool of Political Science This isn't that. Ivan Katchanovski gives no more description of the methods, was it inductive coding, NLPM?, matrix analysis? What and how... Isn't research watched YouTube","date":"2023-07-17","published":"2023-07-17T18:32:44+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1681008833148100608","reply_tweet_id":"1681008833148100608","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Now content analysis of first and accounts or media IS an essential tool of Political Science  <br><br>This isn&#x27;t that.  <br><br>Ivan Katchanovski gives no more description of the methods, was it inductive coding, NLPM?, matrix analysis?  What and how... Isn&#x27;t research watched YouTube</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1681009053399498753","display_date":"July 17, 2023 · 18:32 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
