{"id":"twitter:1680993439851192320","tweet_id":"1680993439851192320","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1680993439851192320","title":"@rlperez4 @benshapiro What Ukrainians do you talk to? Because the one's I know and talk to...yeah they aren't okay with just living. They want to live","summary":"@rlperez4 @benshapiro What Ukrainians do you talk to? Because the one's I know and talk to...yeah they aren't okay with just living. They want to live in a free Ukraine and free from Putin Just as we want to live free as a Nation. Why is self-determination not a democratic value for Ukraine? https://t.co/rRbA77fzr0","date":"2023-07-17","published":"2023-07-17T17:30:42+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/rlperez4/status/1680948164373753857","reply_tweet_id":"1680948164373753857","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@rlperez4 @benshapiro What Ukrainians do you talk to?<br><br>Because the one&#x27;s I know and talk to...yeah they aren&#x27;t okay with just living.<br><br>They want to live in a free Ukraine and free from Putin<br><br>Just as we want to live free as a Nation.<br><br>Why is self-determination not a democratic value for Ukraine? <a href=\"https://t.co/rRbA77fzr0\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/rRbA77fzr0</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/947f80cd15dbe7ee66f93d1528116b98.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1680993439851192320","display_date":"July 17, 2023 · 17:30 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/947f80cd15dbe7ee66f93d1528116b98.jpg"]}
