{"id":"twitter:1680286917571624961","tweet_id":"1680286917571624961","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1680286917571624961","title":"@Emilio2763 @elonmusk @lindayacc People just collect personal stories how they individually decided as a user, per Twitter's TOS and safety policies, ","summary":"@Emilio2763 @elonmusk @lindayacc People just collect personal stories how they individually decided as a user, per Twitter's TOS and safety policies, to report a user. These personal threads get woven into stories around the hashtag #nafoworks some silly fella makes fake action reports, that's all https://t.co/p40uWC1Ayf","date":"2023-07-15","published":"2023-07-15T18:43:14+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1680286139750522883","reply_tweet_id":"1680286139750522883","tags":["nafoworks"],"body_html":"<p>@Emilio2763 @elonmusk @lindayacc People just collect personal stories how they individually decided as a user, per Twitter&#x27;s TOS and safety policies, to report a user.<br><br>These personal threads get woven into stories around the hashtag #nafoworks <br><br>some silly fella makes fake action reports, that&#x27;s all <a href=\"https://t.co/p40uWC1Ayf\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/p40uWC1Ayf</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/7707cb25ac4742761f389044362e3ebc.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1680286917571624961","display_date":"July 15, 2023 · 18:43 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/7707cb25ac4742761f389044362e3ebc.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:1680286139750522883","tweet_id":"1680286139750522883","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1680286139750522883","title":"@Emilio2763 @elonmusk @lindayacc No Silly isn't how Twitter's Reporting or hashtags work. Starts with TOS. Users agree to follow Twitter's rule. In re","summary":"@Emilio2763 @elonmusk @lindayacc No Silly isn't how Twitter's Reporting or hashtags work. Starts with TOS. Users agree to follow Twitter's rule. In return Twitter lays out policies users can follow to report accounts who do not follow the TOS. If an account is Suspended Twitter, not #NAFOworks says so","date":"2023-07-15","published":"2023-07-15T18:40:08+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/Emilio2763/status/1680273058945269761","reply_tweet_id":"1680273058945269761","tags":["NAFOworks"],"body_html":"<p>@Emilio2763 @elonmusk @lindayacc No Silly<br><br> isn&#x27;t how Twitter&#x27;s Reporting or hashtags work.<br><br>Starts with TOS. Users agree to follow Twitter&#x27;s rule. In return Twitter lays out policies users can follow to report accounts who do not follow the TOS.<br><br>If an account is Suspended Twitter, not #NAFOworks says so</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1680286139750522883","display_date":"July 15, 2023 · 18:40 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
