{"id":"twitter:1680261471341510657","tweet_id":"1680261471341510657","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1680261471341510657","title":"@NAFOSATYRBOT137 @ShadowN8V @highbrow_nobrow My PFP is based on Jefferson Letter to Smith about the Shay's Rebellion: https://founders.archives.gov/do","summary":"@NAFOSATYRBOT137 @ShadowN8V @highbrow_nobrow My PFP is based on Jefferson Letter to Smith about the Shay's Rebellion: https://founders.archives.gov/documents/Jefferson/01-12-02-0348 He too notes corrupting power of forever monarchy, but I like that he calls out fake news, calls most rebels fools who need to be set right with the truth ignorant, not seditious","date":"2023-07-15","published":"2023-07-15T17:02:07+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/NAFOSATYRBOT137/status/1680260500234575873","reply_tweet_id":"1680260500234575873","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@NAFOSATYRBOT137 @ShadowN8V @highbrow_nobrow My PFP is based on Jefferson Letter to Smith about the Shay&#x27;s Rebellion: <a href=\"https://founders.archives.gov/documents/Jefferson/01-12-02-0348\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://founders.archives.gov/documents/Jefferson/01-12-02-0348</a><br><br>He too notes corrupting power of forever monarchy, but I like that he calls out fake news, calls most rebels fools who need to be set right with the truth<br><br>ignorant, not seditious</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1680261471341510657","display_date":"July 15, 2023 · 17:02 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
