{"id":"twitter:1679857164490350595","tweet_id":"1679857164490350595","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1679857164490350595","title":"@smith_thesecond @Maks_NAFO_FELLA I disagree I think the story will be told as a case study in full spectrum warfare for years to come. Remember nobod","summary":"@smith_thesecond @Maks_NAFO_FELLA I disagree I think the story will be told as a case study in full spectrum warfare for years to come. Remember nobody in Poland, Russia, or Ukraine could even really write or talk about UPA until 1989. Even during Perestroika the topic was forbidden. We have seen myth spinning","date":"2023-07-14","published":"2023-07-14T14:15:32+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/i/status/1679824668637667328","reply_tweet_id":"1679824668637667328","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@smith_thesecond @Maks_NAFO_FELLA I disagree<br><br>I think the story will be told as a case study in full spectrum warfare for years to come.<br><br>Remember nobody in Poland, Russia, or Ukraine could even really write or talk about UPA until 1989.<br><br>Even during Perestroika the topic was forbidden. We have seen myth spinning</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1679857164490350595","display_date":"July 14, 2023 · 14:15 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
