{"id":"twitter:1679246158827225089","tweet_id":"1679246158827225089","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1679246158827225089","title":"@louisvillegun2 @JeffNeelzebubII @Mk36destructor You have to violate TOS to get suspended. NAFO got no gremlins in the Twitters machine. Even if you g","summary":"@louisvillegun2 @JeffNeelzebubII @Mk36destructor You have to violate TOS to get suspended. NAFO got no gremlins in the Twitters machine. Even if you get mass reported by bot networks (which isn't NAFO) that is usually a delete and wait X days or hours. Don't blame NAFO if Twitter is broken. No gremlins here. https://t.co/XY5A7EoMlZ","date":"2023-07-12","published":"2023-07-12T21:47:37+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/louisvillegun2/status/1679234066028142592","reply_tweet_id":"1679234066028142592","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@louisvillegun2 @JeffNeelzebubII @Mk36destructor You have to violate TOS to get suspended. NAFO got no gremlins in the Twitters machine.<br><br>Even if you get mass reported by bot networks (which isn&#x27;t NAFO) that is usually a delete and wait X days or hours.<br><br>Don&#x27;t blame NAFO if Twitter is broken.<br><br>No gremlins here. <a href=\"https://t.co/XY5A7EoMlZ\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/XY5A7EoMlZ</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/e3d75bf0e835f836fc152983e57455de.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1679246158827225089","display_date":"July 12, 2023 · 21:47 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/e3d75bf0e835f836fc152983e57455de.jpg"]}
