{"id":"twitter:1679216218010427392","tweet_id":"1679216218010427392","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1679216218010427392","title":"@c0smicstarfish @Wagnersfamily @JackPosobiec @elonmusk A group of volunteers who raise money for volunteer units fighting in Ukraine's battle for self","summary":"@c0smicstarfish @Wagnersfamily @JackPosobiec @elonmusk A group of volunteers who raise money for volunteer units fighting in Ukraine's battle for self-determination. It stands for North Atlantic Fella Organization as a play on NATO. They raise money to save Ukrainian lives or take Russian ones. https://t.co/tAXxsDuAoc","date":"2023-07-12","published":"2023-07-12T19:48:39+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/c0smicstarfish/status/1679214576422866945","reply_tweet_id":"1679214576422866945","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@c0smicstarfish @Wagnersfamily @JackPosobiec @elonmusk A group of volunteers who raise money for volunteer units fighting in Ukraine&#x27;s battle for self-determination.<br><br>It stands for North Atlantic Fella Organization as a play on NATO.<br><br>They raise money to save Ukrainian lives or take Russian ones. <a href=\"https://t.co/tAXxsDuAoc\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/tAXxsDuAoc</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/b8bf4045e6194fba0199721413f9cc00.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1679216218010427392","display_date":"July 12, 2023 · 19:48 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/b8bf4045e6194fba0199721413f9cc00.jpg"]}
