{"id":"twitter:1678905156086145026","tweet_id":"1678905156086145026","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1678905156086145026","title":"@TheSwampyTimes @apmassaro3 You can't compare Russian corruption to anywhere in the world. So weird not to call reconquering a former colony and annex","summary":"@TheSwampyTimes @apmassaro3 You can't compare Russian corruption to anywhere in the world. So weird not to call reconquering a former colony and annexing the land NOT an Imperialistic war. Who is the invader? The answer to that is the Imperialist. https://t.co/0GQLLGCVET","date":"2023-07-11","published":"2023-07-11T23:12:36+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/TheSwampyTimes/status/1678904031219990528","reply_tweet_id":"1678904031219990528","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@TheSwampyTimes @apmassaro3 You can&#x27;t compare Russian corruption to anywhere in the world.<br><br>So weird not to call reconquering a former colony and annexing the land NOT an Imperialistic war.<br><br>Who is the invader?<br><br>The answer to that is the Imperialist. <a href=\"https://t.co/0GQLLGCVET\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/0GQLLGCVET</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/8792148f74c2f72568559bd2ba9b4cc9.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1678905156086145026","display_date":"July 11, 2023 · 23:12 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/8792148f74c2f72568559bd2ba9b4cc9.jpg"]}
