{"id":"twitter:1678826518191939584","tweet_id":"1678826518191939584","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1678826518191939584","title":"In a weird way for conservatives to get what they want on free speech you almost have to concede Stephen's was right on Citizens United and Corporatio","summary":"In a weird way for conservatives to get what they want on free speech you almost have to concede Stephen's was right on Citizens United and Corporations as People enshrined in 14th amendment. Stephens was 100% correct that Citizens United was a disaster for National Security.","date":"2023-07-11","published":"2023-07-11T18:00:07+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>In a weird way for conservatives to get what they want on free speech you almost have to concede Stephen&#x27;s was right on Citizens United and Corporations as People enshrined in 14th amendment.<br><br>Stephens was 100% correct that Citizens United was a disaster for National Security.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1678826518191939584","display_date":"July 11, 2023 · 18:00 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
