{"id":"twitter:1678117813716697092","tweet_id":"1678117813716697092","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1678117813716697092","title":"@russianjewess @RealAlexRubi @EVERONA97 @21WIRE My town too. This is a dude at the supermarket. The Ukrainian Catholic Church is down the street. Plen","summary":"@russianjewess @RealAlexRubi @EVERONA97 @21WIRE My town too. This is a dude at the supermarket. The Ukrainian Catholic Church is down the street. Plenty of Orthodox churches. Offer English, Ukrainian, and Russian services Connecticut does have Russian Orthodox churches if if people need to make FSB appointments. https://t.co/OAOiR5rULL","date":"2023-07-09","published":"2023-07-09T19:03:59+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/russianjewess/status/1678106354064453633","reply_tweet_id":"1678106354064453633","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@russianjewess @RealAlexRubi @EVERONA97 @21WIRE My town too.<br><br>This is a dude at the supermarket.<br><br>The Ukrainian Catholic Church is down the street.<br><br>Plenty of Orthodox churches.<br><br>Offer English, Ukrainian, and Russian services<br><br> Connecticut does have Russian Orthodox churches if  if people need to make FSB appointments. <a href=\"https://t.co/OAOiR5rULL\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/OAOiR5rULL</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/3e1e707859a737956979759f2ee46fa4.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1678117813716697092","display_date":"July 09, 2023 · 19:03 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/3e1e707859a737956979759f2ee46fa4.jpg"]}
