{"id":"twitter:1677858307065753600","tweet_id":"1677858307065753600","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1677858307065753600","title":"@JoohnChoe Swing and a miss on this one. Not every joke can be good, but I find pronunciation one of those areas where it's better to choose other pun","summary":"@JoohnChoe Swing and a miss on this one. Not every joke can be good, but I find pronunciation one of those areas where it's better to choose other punchlines. Same with name spellings (like Vowels)...unless you know it's fake. I'd rather celebrate a Prime Minister saying BASED","date":"2023-07-09","published":"2023-07-09T01:52:48+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/JoohnChoe/status/1677774467546882048","reply_tweet_id":"1677774467546882048","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@JoohnChoe Swing and a miss on this one.<br><br>Not every joke can be good, but I find pronunciation one of those areas where it&#x27;s better to choose other punchlines.<br><br>Same with name spellings (like Vowels)...unless you know it&#x27;s fake.<br><br>I&#x27;d rather celebrate a Prime Minister saying BASED</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1677858307065753600","display_date":"July 09, 2023 · 01:52 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
