{"id":"twitter:1677282365712867329","tweet_id":"1677282365712867329","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1677282365712867329","title":"@generalgosha @Dansken_swe @Lasurak @visegrad24 But what about her, the crow? She will stay in this field forever Because only this cry of hers Holds ","summary":"@generalgosha @Dansken_swe @Lasurak @visegrad24 But what about her, the crow? She will stay in this field forever Because only this cry of hers Holds all those swallows in the air Do you hear how she calls Each one by her name? ---- Russia has tried to eliminate Ukrainian poets, novelists, and language for centuries https://t.co/Qn6ZjjnBrT","date":"2023-07-07","published":"2023-07-07T11:44:13+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/generalgosha/status/1677279733384355840","reply_tweet_id":"1677279733384355840","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@generalgosha @Dansken_swe @Lasurak @visegrad24 But what about her, the crow?<br><br>She will stay in this field forever<br><br>Because only this cry of hers<br><br>Holds all those swallows in the air<br><br>Do you hear how she calls<br><br>Each one by her name?<br><br>----<br><br>Russia has tried to eliminate Ukrainian poets, novelists, and language for centuries <a href=\"https://t.co/Qn6ZjjnBrT\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/Qn6ZjjnBrT</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/e52736355f68ba8d0f01393c76e4d601.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1677282365712867329","display_date":"July 07, 2023 · 11:44 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/e52736355f68ba8d0f01393c76e4d601.jpg"]}
