{"id":"twitter:1676905886290198528","tweet_id":"1676905886290198528","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1676905886290198528","title":"@Reynev4n @Maks_NAFO_FELLA We did a bit of an over correction with consolidation and streamlining after Cold War based on Chicago Economics. And Iraq ","summary":"@Reynev4n @Maks_NAFO_FELLA We did a bit of an over correction with consolidation and streamlining after Cold War based on Chicago Economics. And Iraq and Afghanistan weren't traditional ground and pound wars so we put heavy emphasis oh cool whiz bang. Ukraine shows NATO needs old school bang bang.","date":"2023-07-06","published":"2023-07-06T10:48:13+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/Reynev4n/status/1676905015904968704","reply_tweet_id":"1676905015904968704","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Reynev4n @Maks_NAFO_FELLA We did a bit of an over correction with consolidation and streamlining after Cold War based on Chicago Economics.<br><br>And Iraq and Afghanistan weren&#x27;t traditional ground and pound wars so we put heavy emphasis oh cool whiz bang.<br><br>Ukraine shows NATO needs old school bang bang.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1676905886290198528","display_date":"July 06, 2023 · 10:48 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
