{"id":"twitter:1676312373554999310","tweet_id":"1676312373554999310","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1676312373554999310","title":"pain nor decency. Each layered to looms patterns in time tracking moons. As shackles shed, clearing space for freedom's pass You can choose to propel.","summary":"pain nor decency. Each layered to looms patterns in time tracking moons. As shackles shed, clearing space for freedom's pass You can choose to propel. Push freedom forward for those against the wall by making those simple calls #smallpoems 2/2","date":"2023-07-04","published":"2023-07-04T19:29:48+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1676312184228311055","reply_tweet_id":"1676312184228311055","tags":["smallpoems"],"body_html":"<p>pain nor decency.  <br>Each layered to looms<br>patterns in time<br>tracking moons.<br> As shackles shed, clearing<br>space for freedom&#x27;s<br>pass<br>You can choose<br>to propel.<br>Push freedom forward <br>for those against the wall<br>by making those simple calls<br>#smallpoems<br>2/2</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1676312373554999310","display_date":"July 04, 2023 · 19:29 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1676312184228311055","tweet_id":"1676312184228311055","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1676312184228311055","title":"Freedom unfurls when Democracy is lived Framing Human Nature in Choice. Many Voices woven freely in air sing burdens of Freedom. Bound liberty in fine","summary":"Freedom unfurls when Democracy is lived Framing Human Nature in Choice. Many Voices woven freely in air sing burdens of Freedom. Bound liberty in fine cloth. Woven fibers of determined province. For will, with no chains does not break threads of 1/2 #smallpoems","date":"2023-07-04","published":"2023-07-04T19:29:03+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":["smallpoems"],"body_html":"<p>Freedom unfurls when<br> Democracy is lived<br> Framing Human Nature<br>in Choice. <br> Many Voices<br> woven freely in air<br>sing<br>burdens of Freedom.<br> Bound liberty<br> in fine cloth.<br>Woven fibers of<br>determined<br> province. For<br>will, with no chains<br>does not break threads of<br>1/2<br>#smallpoems</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1676312184228311055","display_date":"July 04, 2023 · 19:29 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
