{"id":"twitter:2021054618688684209","tweet_id":"2021054618688684209","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2021054618688684209","title":"@RavenCreative2 @GeorgeProust Money matters, Trump won by getting people not to vote more than to vote That's the split ticket. High Propensity voters","summary":"@RavenCreative2 @GeorgeProust Money matters, Trump won by getting people not to vote more than to vote That's the split ticket. High Propensity voters that skipped top of ticket, and low propensity voters that only voted top Same in. Hispanic and Latin communities. Yes gains, but margins were in not voting","date":"2026-02-10","published":"2026-02-10T02:52:25+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/RavenCreative2/status/2021053972140970357","reply_tweet_id":"2021053972140970357","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@RavenCreative2 @GeorgeProust Money matters, Trump won by getting people not to vote more than to vote<br><br>That&#x27;s the split ticket. High Propensity voters that skipped top of ticket, and low propensity voters that only voted top<br><br>Same in. Hispanic and Latin communities. Yes gains, but margins were in not voting</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2021054618688684209","display_date":"February 10, 2026 · 02:52 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
