{"id":"twitter:1675306149044789248","tweet_id":"1675306149044789248","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1675306149044789248","title":"@r0739290 @Maks_NAFO_FELLA This is what it is about Elon thinks ChatGPT \"stole\" data that was readily available on the web for anyone to read. Data th","summary":"@r0739290 @Maks_NAFO_FELLA This is what it is about Elon thinks ChatGPT \"stole\" data that was readily available on the web for anyone to read. Data that people gathered through acceptable developer TOS You can read the rules of the road every time you authorize a new app","date":"2023-07-02","published":"2023-07-02T00:51:26+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/i/status/1675302867740008453","reply_tweet_id":"1675302867740008453","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@r0739290 @Maks_NAFO_FELLA This is what it is about<br><br>Elon thinks ChatGPT &quot;stole&quot; data that was readily available on the web for anyone to read.<br><br>Data that people gathered through acceptable developer TOS<br><br>You can read the rules of the road every time you authorize a new app</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1675306149044789248","display_date":"July 02, 2023 · 00:51 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1675303926575296513","tweet_id":"1675303926575296513","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1675303926575296513","title":"@r0739290 @Maks_NAFO_FELLA I understand how it works. I know the egress makes the bulk of the bandwidth but call per call ingress has to be more. Espe","summary":"@r0739290 @Maks_NAFO_FELLA I understand how it works. I know the egress makes the bulk of the bandwidth but call per call ingress has to be more. Especially media upload. I have 40+ columns in Tweetdeck going. I could hit 600 calls in ten minutes.","date":"2023-07-02","published":"2023-07-02T00:42:36+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/i/status/1675302366378115073","reply_tweet_id":"1675302366378115073","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@r0739290 @Maks_NAFO_FELLA I understand how it works.<br><br>I know the egress makes the bulk of the bandwidth but call per call ingress has to be more. Especially media upload.<br><br>I have 40+ columns in Tweetdeck going. I could hit 600 calls in ten minutes.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1675303926575296513","display_date":"July 02, 2023 · 00:42 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
