{"id":"twitter:1675299671881797632","tweet_id":"1675299671881797632","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1675299671881797632","title":"@MyEyesRNowOpen @misteryrobozo He isn't correct. Plenty of companies can handle the ingress and egress Open data is not a threat to the Open Web or de","summary":"@MyEyesRNowOpen @misteryrobozo He isn't correct. Plenty of companies can handle the ingress and egress Open data is not a threat to the Open Web or democracy. Shutting down the read API for academics, journalists, and researchers does.","date":"2023-07-02","published":"2023-07-02T00:25:41+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/MyEyesRNowOpen/status/1675279504317489152","reply_tweet_id":"1675279504317489152","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@MyEyesRNowOpen @misteryrobozo He isn&#x27;t correct.<br><br>Plenty of companies can handle the ingress and egress<br><br>Open data is not a threat to the Open Web or democracy.<br><br>Shutting down the read API for academics, journalists, and researchers does.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1675299671881797632","display_date":"July 02, 2023 · 00:25 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
