{"id":"twitter:1674216745542774786","tweet_id":"1674216745542774786","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1674216745542774786","title":"Well another vacation with a trip to emergency room. Amakes three. No stitches but Kid a little bummed about no Ocean. Nothing some jersey corn and mi","summary":"Well another vacation with a trip to emergency room. Amakes three. No stitches but Kid a little bummed about no Ocean. Nothing some jersey corn and mim's goulash can't fix. The waves were spectacular for New Jersey. 3-6 swells, mild undertoe, perfect weather. https://t.co/TnM3ZWRnqb","date":"2023-06-29","published":"2023-06-29T00:42:32+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Well another vacation with a trip to emergency room.<br><br> Amakes three.<br><br>No stitches but Kid a little bummed about no Ocean.<br><br>Nothing some jersey corn and mim&#x27;s goulash can&#x27;t fix.<br><br>The waves were spectacular for New Jersey.<br><br>3-6 swells, mild undertoe, perfect weather. <a href=\"https://t.co/TnM3ZWRnqb\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/TnM3ZWRnqb</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/d2092f30fc75b9aaadb87ffd16c99e82.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1674216745542774786","display_date":"June 29, 2023 · 00:42 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/d2092f30fc75b9aaadb87ffd16c99e82.jpg"]}
