{"id":"twitter:1674037810238484486","tweet_id":"1674037810238484486","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1674037810238484486","title":"@IrynaVoichuk It is a known critical vulnerability. There is a MITRE CSV about it. You get mass followed, and then they report to block you. Knocks yo","summary":"@IrynaVoichuk It is a known critical vulnerability. There is a MITRE CSV about it. You get mass followed, and then they report to block you. Knocks your account out for a few hours.. One week at the most. Only thing you can do is block people who follow you en masse if you see it.","date":"2023-06-28","published":"2023-06-28T12:51:30+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/IrynaVoichuk/status/1674011354242351104","reply_tweet_id":"1674011354242351104","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@IrynaVoichuk It is a known critical vulnerability.<br><br>There is a MITRE CSV about it.<br><br>You get mass followed, and then they report to block you.<br><br>Knocks your account out for a few hours.. One week at the most.<br><br>Only thing you can do is block people who follow you en masse if you see it.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1674037810238484486","display_date":"June 28, 2023 · 12:51 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
