{"id":"twitter:1673680435618955265","tweet_id":"1673680435618955265","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1673680435618955265","title":"@chrislarry33 @Nickiquote I didn't say it worked well. Try to RT with the spam policy ban on. On mobile you will see the RT get highlighted and then u","summary":"@chrislarry33 @Nickiquote I didn't say it worked well. Try to RT with the spam policy ban on. On mobile you will see the RT get highlighted and then unhighlited. Checking mobile and desktop now. Also a favor to MAGA/Kim Dotcom/FSB who complain about \"Russian messaging\" getting spammed.","date":"2023-06-27","published":"2023-06-27T13:11:25+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/i/status/1673679461395447811","reply_tweet_id":"1673679461395447811","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@chrislarry33 @Nickiquote I didn&#x27;t say it worked well.<br><br>Try to RT with the spam policy ban on.<br><br>On mobile you will see the RT get highlighted and then unhighlited.<br><br>Checking mobile and desktop now.<br><br>Also  a favor to MAGA/Kim Dotcom/FSB who complain about &quot;Russian messaging&quot; getting spammed.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1673680435618955265","display_date":"June 27, 2023 · 13:11 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
