{"id":"twitter:1673676014264762372","tweet_id":"1673676014264762372","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1673676014264762372","title":"@chrislarry33 @Nickiquote We have been doing some experimenting. Freinds think they have discovered that doing more than RT a minute will trigger spam","summary":"@chrislarry33 @Nickiquote We have been doing some experimenting. Freinds think they have discovered that doing more than RT a minute will trigger spam policy ban. Best we can tell only one RT per minute sticka when banned It is a 100% blue check shakedown with the benefit of reducing RT server load.","date":"2023-06-27","published":"2023-06-27T12:53:51+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/i/status/1673664814940291075","reply_tweet_id":"1673664814940291075","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@chrislarry33 @Nickiquote We have been doing some experimenting.<br><br>Freinds think they have discovered that doing more than RT a minute will trigger spam policy ban.<br><br>Best we can tell only one RT per minute sticka when banned <br><br>It is a 100% blue check shakedown with the benefit of reducing RT server load.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1673676014264762372","display_date":"June 27, 2023 · 12:53 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
